      },
      {
        "introduction": "Following these genealogies is a record of the people of Jerusalem, but the specific time, either before or after the exile, is not entirely clear. It does seem to correspond most closely, however, to similar listings in Nehemiah’s accounts. If so, these are the families living in Jerusalem at the very time that these national archives are being compiled."
